                                "sense_id": "f7f872e6-d085-3644-a3e4-4f2f414db56d",
                                "text": "The ironic Eden of the toll station is dominated by old, overgrown and underrooted apple trees which, like the original apple tree in the Garden , threaten to destroy the entire establishment every time there is a storm ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6bb61163-653e-4051-aa8e-802ecb958c61",
                                "sense_id": "f7f872e6-d085-3644-a3e4-4f2f414db56d",
                                "text": "These underrooted plants (especially in lower light levels) are your greatest concern."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "16e6f71d-3784-4d95-8db2-c4a33b64497d",
                                "sense_id": "f7f872e6-d085-3644-a3e4-4f2f414db56d",
                                "text": "The result is undersized, underrooted, overfertilized but still undernourished, low-grade plants rushed up through the system."
